  "episode_title": "I'll never give up hope",
  "conversations": [
    {
      "id": "L-S2E01-C01",
      "title": "Landon feels that the most important piece of his life is missing.",
      "description": "Alone at the school during the summer, Landon reflects that he finally has everything he wanted, yet something essential is missing and he can't tell what.",
      "participants": [
        {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Hopeless Landon"
        }
      ],
      "subjects": [],
      "scene_type": "speech",
      "tags": [
        "forgotten",
        "missing",
        "angst"
      ],
      "importance": 3,
      "verified": true,
      "full": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C01-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "Except for those who have nowhere to go, the ones like me."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C01-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "My name is Landon Kirby. All I've ever wanted to know is where I come from, to have a home, a family, to be special. Recently, I got all of it."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C01-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "So why do I feel like nothing's changed? Somehow it feels like the most important piece of my life is missing."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C01-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "I know I need to keep searching for answers because as far as I can tell, being immortal means being alone. And being alone is Hopeless."
          }
        ]
      },
      "short": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C01-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "So why do I feel like nothing's changed? Somehow it feels like the most important piece of my life is missing."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C01-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "I know I need to keep searching for answers because as far as I can tell, being immortal means being alone. And being alone is Hopeless."
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "L-S2E01-C02",
      "title": "Landon promises Rafael he will never give up hope.",
      "description": "Landon brings food to Rafael, who is stuck in wolf form, and promises to find a way to turn him back.",
      "participants": [
        {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Hopeless Landon"
        }
      ],
      "subjects": [],
      "scene_type": "conversation",
      "tags": [
        "forgotten",
        "determination"
      ],
      "importance": 2,
      "verified": true,
      "full": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C02-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "I suck at this. My best friend used to say he'd rather starve than eat anything I tried to make, but you already know that."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C02-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "That's good. I know you're in there, Raf. I'm gonna find a way to get you back, and then everything will be good again, okay?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C02-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "I'll never give up Hope."
          }
        ]
      },
      "short": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C02-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "I'll never give up Hope."
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "L-S2E01-C03",
      "title": "Hope leaves Clarke behind to get back to Landon.",
      "description": "Inside Malivore, Hope uses a truth spell on Clarke and works out that Malivore is trying to expel her. She refuses to take Clarke with her because she has to get back to Landon.",
      "participants": [
        {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        {
          "character": "Clarke",
          "version": "Clarke"
        }
      ],
      "subjects": [],
      "scene_type": "conversation",
      "tags": [
        "malivore",
        "determination",
        "protect"
      ],
      "importance": 3,
      "verified": true,
      "full": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C03-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "This entire time, I've been working on a theory, you know, trying to figure out why the vortex comes. And then I realized, it's always after I do magic. Am I getting warm?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C03-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Clarke",
              "version": "Clarke"
            },
            "text": "Scalding."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C03-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "You know, it makes a lot of sense when you think about it. I thought that I was wrong about me being the only one who could destroy him, but I think my actual mistake was that I, I wasn't a fully activated Tribrid when I dove into that pit. I've never died, so my vampire side hasn't been activated yet."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C03-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "And what I'm realizing now is that Malivore doesn't want me here. I'm toxic to him. Finish that sentence, please?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C03-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Clarke",
              "version": "Clarke"
            },
            "text": "Malivore's trying to expel you. To send you back from where you came."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C03-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "And every time he tries..."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C03-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Clarke",
              "version": "Clarke"
            },
            "text": "I grab hold of you to try to get expelled with you. But as much as my father wants you to leave, he wants to keep torturing me here even more."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C03-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Then it's official. All we have to do is wait."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C03-T09",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Clarke",
              "version": "Clarke"
            },
            "text": "For what?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C03-T10",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "That's my ride."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C03-T11",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Clarke",
              "version": "Clarke"
            },
            "text": "Hope, you can't leave me here."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C03-T12",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "I can't leave with you. Okay? I have to get back to my friends. I have to get back to Landon."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C03-T13",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Clarke",
              "version": "Clarke"
            },
            "text": "I can't lie, right? So you know I'm telling the truth when I say that if you help me go back, too, you'll never see me again. I promise."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C03-T14",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "I'm sorry. But do you understand why I can't take that risk?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C03-T15",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Clarke",
              "version": "Clarke"
            },
            "text": "Yeah. I would do the same thing if I were you. God."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C03-T16",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Good luck, Clarke."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C03-T17",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Clarke",
              "version": "Clarke"
            },
            "text": "Screw you, Hope."
          }
        ]
      },
      "short": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C03-T11",
