    {
      "id": "L-S2E01-C04",
      "title": "Hope comes back to the school looking for Landon.",
      "description": "Back from Malivore, Hope runs into Dorian outside the school. He doesn't remember her, and she tells him she came for a boy.",
      "participants": [
        {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        {
          "character": "Dorian",
          "version": "Dorian"
        }
      ],
      "subjects": [],
      "scene_type": "conversation",
      "tags": [
        "forgotten",
        "search"
      ],
      "importance": 3,
      "verified": true,
      "full": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C04-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Dorian",
              "version": "Dorian"
            },
            "text": "I didn't see you. Are you okay?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C04-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Yeah, Dorian, I'm okay."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C04-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Dorian",
              "version": "Dorian"
            },
            "text": "Glad to hear it, but how did you know my name?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C04-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Your parking pass."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C04-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Dorian",
              "version": "Dorian"
            },
            "text": "Always hated that picture. What brings you out here tonight?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C04-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "A boy."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C04-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Dorian",
              "version": "Dorian"
            },
            "text": "Well, we're all locked up in there. Everyone's gone for the summer."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C04-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Okay. Thanks. Uh, sorry to bother you."
          }
        ]
      },
      "short": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C04-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Dorian",
              "version": "Dorian"
            },
            "text": "Always hated that picture. What brings you out here tonight?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C04-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "A boy."
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "L-S2E01-C05",
      "title": "Hope talks with hologram Landon and asks if he is happy.",
      "description": "Hope uses the prism to talk to Landon's hologram about leaving town without telling him she is back. He insists the real Landon would want to know, but when she asks whether he and everyone else are happier now, he has no answer.",
      "participants": [
        {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Hologram Landon"
        }
      ],
      "subjects": [],
      "scene_type": "conversation",
      "tags": [
        "hologram",
        "forgotten",
        "love",
        "sacrifice",
        "jealous",
        "angst",
        "crying",
        "eyes"
      ],
      "importance": 5,
      "verified": true,
      "full": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hologram Landon"
            },
            "text": "Hey. Is this seat taken?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "action": "smiles"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Landon."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hologram Landon"
            },
            "text": "Wait, how do you know my name?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hologram Landon"
            },
            "text": "Sorry. There's no way I'd even pretend to forget Hope Mikaelson."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "You're just saying that because you know I want to hear it."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hologram Landon"
            },
            "text": "Well, actually, that's not how this works. I'm kind of here to tell you the things you don't want to hear, right?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Yeah. I really needed to see you."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T09",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hologram Landon"
            },
            "text": "Happy to be seen. Well, I mean, as happy as the magical holographic manifestation of your subconscious can be. So what's on your mind?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T10",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "I missed your eyes."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T11",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hologram Landon"
            },
            "text": "Oh, admittedly, they're pretty dreamy."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T12",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "So much for accuracy. Landon would never say that."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T13",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hologram Landon"
            },
            "text": "Well, it's creative license. Besides, let's face it, you already know what he'd say about your current dilemma."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T14",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Then maybe I just want to hear it from fake you."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T15",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hologram Landon"
            },
            "text": "Fine. Then, in that case, there is no world in which I would ever want you to leave town without telling me you're back from the dead."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T16",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "I never died, technically."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T17",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hologram Landon"
            },
            "text": "Then I'd want to hear about that, too. I'd want to hear about everything because I love you, and you love me. You leaving town is a stupid move and you know it. Especially after we agreed not to lie to each other."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T18",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Don't turn this around on me. Okay, besides, what's happening between you and Josie? Ugh."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T19",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hologram Landon"
            },
            "text": "So you're mad at me?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T20",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "No. I'm not mad at you. I can't be mad at you, right? It's not your fault. You don't even know I exist."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T21",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hologram Landon"
            },
            "text": "But that still hurts."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T22",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Of course it does."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T23",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hologram Landon"
            },
            "text": "Okay. So, then think about how much it would hurt me to find out you're just down the road."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T24",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Fair enough. If you can answer this one question correctly, then I promise I'll go running back to you, and I'll, I'll tell you the whole truth."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T25",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hologram Landon"
            },
            "text": "Would you quit playing games? There is no answer either of us could give that should stop you from doing that right now."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T26",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Are you happy? Is everyone happier now?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T27",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "action": "cries"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T28",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Could you leave me for a minute? I don't really want to cry in front of you, even if you're fake."
          }
        ]
      },
      "short": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T17",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hologram Landon"
            },
            "text": "Then I'd want to hear about that, too. I'd want to hear about everything because I love you, and you love me. You leaving town is a stupid move and you know it. Especially after we agreed not to lie to each other."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T18",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Don't turn this around on me. Okay, besides, what's happening between you and Josie? Ugh."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T19",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hologram Landon"
            },
            "text": "So you're mad at me?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T20",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "No. I'm not mad at you. I can't be mad at you, right? It's not your fault. You don't even know I exist."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T21",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hologram Landon"
            },
            "text": "But that still hurts."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T22",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Of course it does."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T23",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hologram Landon"
            },
            "text": "Okay. So, then think about how much it would hurt me to find out you're just down the road."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E01-C05-T24",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Fair enough. If you can answer this one question correctly, then I promise I'll go running back to you, and I'll, I'll tell you the whole truth."
          },
          {
